        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ink Enigma: Hidden Object Challenges turns every hand-drawn puzzle page into your personal sketchbook. Scan the scene, circle each secret, and watch the artwork come alive with your own signature ink.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why It Feels So Good</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw to Discover – Spot an item, press the trigger, and shhkk!—a lively marker-stroke wraps around it as if you sketched it yourself. A crisp checklist tick follows with an old-school paper-flip sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Page-Turner Puzzles – Enjoy a growing gallery of lovingly illustrated scenes, with even more discoveries planned for future updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personal Best Timing – Every page records your fastest completion time, inviting you to out-ink your own record whenever inspiration strikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Marker, Your Style – Tweak opacity, thickness, and hue: go subtle pencil-grey or blaze neon—no two finished pages have to look the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax &amp; Recline – Warm parchment tones, gentle jazz-hop loops, zero jump-scares. Perfect for five-minute brain breaks or long, cozy play sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick-Up-and-Play Controls – Controller, mouse, or touch—the UI instantly adapts to whatever you grab.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ink Enigma: Hidden Object Challenges turns every hand-drawn puzzle page into your personal sketchbook. Scan the scene, circle each secret, and watch the artwork come alive with your own signature ink.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why It Feels So Good</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw to Discover – Spot an item, press the trigger, and shhkk!—a lively marker-stroke wraps around it as if you sketched it yourself. A crisp checklist tick follows with an old-school paper-flip sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Page-Turner Puzzles – Enjoy a growing gallery of lovingly illustrated scenes, with even more discoveries planned for future updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personal Best Timing – Every page records your fastest completion time, inviting you to out-ink your own record whenever inspiration strikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Marker, Your Style – Tweak opacity, thickness, and hue: go subtle pencil-grey or blaze neon—no two finished pages have to look the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax &amp; Recline – Warm parchment tones, gentle jazz-hop loops, zero jump-scares. Perfect for five-minute brain breaks or long, cozy play sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick-Up-and-Play Controls – Controller, mouse, or touch—the UI instantly adapts to whatever you grab.</p>",
        "short_description": "A nostalgic hidden‑object experience shaped by ’90s/2000s print puzzles. Circle each find with that satisfying marker “shhkk,” tick the list with a paper‑flip, and relax through 35+ warmly illustrated pages.",
